- StartKit: {v: 1, kind (strength | run | other), title, sessionType, discipline, date, plannedLineage, plannedSessionId, programId and versionNumber (all null for ad-hoc), units {weight, distance} from the owner's profile, exercises, run {segments: M3's RunSegment[]}, other {kind, durationMinutes, targetRpe, metrics template}}
